    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24011" root="صدق" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدُوقٌ</span></b>  <i>Having the quality of speaking, saying,
uttering,</i> or <i>telling, truth,</i> or <i>truly,</i> or <i>veraciously,
in a high,</i> or <i>an eminent, degree; very,</i> or <i>eminently, true</i> or <i>veracious:</i> (Msb:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُدُقٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُدْقٌ</span>. (K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْدَقُ</span>.

